  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Aavas Financiers Expanding Access to Finance for Lower-Income Housing and Micro, Small, and Medium-Sized Enterprises Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ADB will provide long-term senior secured debt financing to Aavas Financiers Limited to support (i) housing loans for economically weaker section (EWS) and low-income group (LIG) borrowers, with a target for women property owners, and (ii)business loans for micro, small, and medium-sized enterprises (MSMEs).</narrative>
  </description>
